    26	transfers), any instruction that writes the stack pointer in a way not modelled here, an indirect
    27	branch or call, a branch leaving its function, two different depths at one address, a return at a
    28	nonzero depth, recursion, or a call to a function that is neither Concrete-owned nor a PLT/stub
