The direct round-4 reproducers are now refused. I’ve reproduced two remaining holes: dropping a saved-slot tag lets the stored frame pointer escape through a later load, and `ldp x29, x30, [x0]` bypasses link-register validation. I’m also checking whether calls preserve the caller’s tracked frame pointer.
